  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alooni na bitūnja bakwe ha nīmo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wenhage ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe, nī shizwalo shabo, hamò na a maguta ga kūbitīīla, ūyenhe nī nzagamba ya shitambò sha būkenagūji, nī ng'ondi ījo ibīlī, nī shigabbu sha migatī īyo ītī na shibimbya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma bitanage pye a Baisilaeli bikuminge a ha būtongi wa nyango gw'iheema lya kwibilingīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa wīta gīt'ūmo akalagīīlīlwa na SEEBA, ī libità libilinga a ha nyango gw'iheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūbawīla a banhū abo baalī bibilinga, “Gūūyū mhayo walagīlile ū SEEBA gīkī gwigelile gwītwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Musa ūng'wenha ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe, ūbooja na minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnzwalīkīja ū Alooni ī lishadi lyakwe lya nīmo, ūntunga nū ngwasho ū mu nkīmbīlī gwakwe; ūnzwīka nī ng'hanjo ī nguhī, hanuma nī ng'hanjo ya nyagabīji ī ya makono maguhī. Nū ngwasho gwa ha ng'hanjo ya nyagabīji ya makono maguhī ūyo gūbeejiwe na būgaliili no no no ūgūtunga chiza chiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a kamfuko ka ha shikuba ūntūūlīla, nī Ulimu nī Tumimu ūshitūūla ū mu kamfuko ka ha shikuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho wītūūla ī ngoofiila a ha ntwe go ng'wa Alooni, nī libalala lya zahabu ī lyeela ūlītūūla a ha būtongi wa ngoofiila, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla dūhū ū Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūgasola a maguta ga kūbila, ūlīseeseebela ī lipandī lya kwikala nī shikolo shaamo ī shose, ūsheeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mininga gamò ūgaseeseebela ha ng'walīlo ng'hangala mpungatī, ūgūbila na maguta ū ng'walīlo nī shikolo sha kūtūmamīla ho pyī ī shose; nī shiseme sha kūkalabīla nī likīndīkīlo lyasho; ūsheeja ī shikolo shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Witīīla maguta magehu a ha ntwe go ng'wa Alooni, ūng'witīīla maguta, ūng'weeja kūlwa nguno ya nīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūbenha na a bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni, ūbazwalīkīja a mashadi gabo ga milīmo, ūbatunga nī migwasho yabo, hūna ūbatunga shitambaala ū kū mitwe yabo, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha kūlwa bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūyenha ī nzagamba ya shitambò sha shibi, ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe būtūūla a makono gabo a ha ntwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa wīsīnza ī nzagamba yenīyo, ūgasola a mininga gayo magehu ūgabilīja a ha mapembe ga ha ng'walīlo būnè wago, ūgweeja ū ng'walīlo. A mininga ayo gakasaagīīla ūgiita ha sī, aho gwalī gwīmīīlile ū ng'walīlo, ūgwītīla isangī ūgweeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūgīnja pye a masazu ayo gakabizaga gakundīkīgije sha mu nda, na a yayo gakundīkīgije hitīma, nī mhīgo hamò na a masazu gajo; ī shose shenīshi ūshipemba ha ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī nyama ya nzagamba nī likūnza, nū būūshi wayo, ūshipemba moto hanze ya ng'hambī, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūyeenha nī ng'ondi ya shitambò sha kūpemva, ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe būtūūla a makono gabo a ha ntwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa wīsīnza ī ng'ondi yenīyo; a mininga gayo ūgaseeseebela a ha ng'walīlo mhande jago jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ondi wībbutagūla mapingili mapingili; a mapingili genayo ūgoocha mu moto hamò nū ntwe, na masazu gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sha mu nda nī chūūga ūshooja na minzī. Ī ng'ondi yenīyo wīpemba ha ng'walīlo pyī ī yose, yūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva, sha kwenha ng'waso gwawiza, shakwinha sha kūbeejiwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha kūlwa kūtūūlwa ha nīmo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nī ng'ondi ī yīngī ūyeenha, ī ya kūfunyiwa kūlwa kūtūūlwa kwabo ha nīmo; ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe bītūūlīla a makono gabo a ha ntwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa wīsīnza, ūsola mininga gayo magehu ūgabila a ha gūtū go ng'wa Alooni ū gwa būlyo, na a h'ikuulume lya nkono gwakwe gwa būlyo, nī likuulume lya lūpambalà lwa gūgūlū gwa būlyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūbeegeleja na a bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni, nabo ūbabila a mininga, būlī ng'wene ū kū gūtū gwakwe gwa būlyo, nū kwikuulume lya nkono gwa būlyo, na h'ikuulume lya kū lūpambalà lwa kū gūgūlū gwa būlyo. Nū ng'walīlo ūgūseeseebela a mininga mhande jago jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgasola a maguta ga ng'ondi yenīyo nū nkīla gwayo ū gwizezele, na a masazu pye ayo gakabizaga gakundīkīgije sha mu nda, na a yayo gakundīkīgije h'itīma, nī mhīgo būbīlī wajo na a masazu gajo, nū kūlūmbū kwa būlyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mu shigabbu sha migatī ītī na shibimbya, īsho shalī kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ūsola mo ngatī gūmò, ūsola na gūngī gūbeegije na būsu būsangije maguta, na gūngī ng'ūūmu gītī lūgūkūlū; ī shose shenīshi ūshitūūla hamò na a masazu ga ng'ondi, nū kūlūmbū kwa būlyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūshitūūla mu makono ga ng'wa Alooni na bitūnja bakwe, būshiyengeeja kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, shūbiza shakwinha sha kūyengeejiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshisola hangī ū Musa kūfuma ū mu makono gabo, ūshipemba ha ng'walīlo, a higūlya ya shitambò sha kūpemva; shūbiza shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa kūlwa kūtūūlwa ha nīmo, sha ng'waso gwawiza, shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūshisola nī shiguuku sha ng'ondi yenīyo, īsho walī ahelelilwe wei ng'wenekīlī, nasho ūshiyengeeja kū bū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, shūbiza shakwinha sha kūyengeejiwa, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla dūhū ū Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikanza lya kūtūūlwa ha nīmo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūsola maguta magehu a ga kūbitīīla batūmami, na mininga magehu kūfuma ha ng'walīlo, ūnseeseebela ū Alooni nī shizwalo shakwe; hamò na a bitūnja bakwe nī shizwalo shabo, ūbiza wang'weeja ū Alooni nī shizwalo shakwe, hamò na a bitūnja bakwe, nī shizwalo shabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Musa ūng'wīla ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe, “Ī nyama yenīyī īzugīlagi ha nyango gwa h'iheema lya kwibilingīla, ng'wīlīīle henaho, hamò nī migatī ya mu shigabbu sha migatī ya shakwinha h'ikanza lya kūtūūlwa ha nīmo; h'ūmo nakalagīīlīlwa, gīkī, ‘Ī shenīshi shilī sha kūlyiwa na Alooni na bitūnja bakwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ī nyama īyo īlashiige hamò nū ngatī, ūkūshipemba mu moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama yaya ū kwīnga a ha nyango gwa hiheema lya kwibilingīla, kūshisha jishike shikū mpungatī, ījo jihelilwe kūlwikanza lya kūtūūlwa kwing'we ha nīmo; ī likanza lya shikū mpungatī īlo līhelilwe kūlwa kūtūūlwa kwing'we ha nīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyo ng'wītīlagwa leelo yenīyī īlagīlilwe na SEEBA, kūlwa kūmubeegeja isangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla mukwikala ho shikū mpungatī, līīmi na būjikū, mushikīlīje īyo ayīlagīlile ū SEEBA, mutizūcha; nguno h'ūmo naalagīīlilwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe bakīīta pyī ī yose īyo SEEBA walī wabalagīla mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
